{"name": "Mithrall", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"62\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838890/extras/a797a247fa66735bd2bc951bdaf200b5.poster.avif?t=1781544879\" width=\"616\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838890/extras/a797a247fa66735bd2bc951bdaf200b5.webm?t=1781544879\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838890/extras/a797a247fa66735bd2bc951bdaf200b5.mp4?t=1781544879\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Forge Your Legend in a Living World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into a vast, ever-evolving realm where survival, conquest, and creativity collide. Every player shapes the world \u2014 whether you build towering fortresses, wage epic battles, or carve out hidden kingdoms beneath the earth.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"346\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838890/extras/8149f044e289f818e6d653de8de8b7d2.poster.avif?t=1781544879\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838890/extras/8149f044e289f818e6d653de8de8b7d2.webm?t=1781544879\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838890/extras/8149f044e289f818e6d653de8de8b7d2.mp4?t=1781544879\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Play Your Way \u2013 No Classes, Just Choices</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wield any weapon, wear any gear, and define your own playstyle. Swap between heavy armor and massive hammers, swift blades and leather gear, or ranged magic with flowing robes \u2014 your equipment determines your abilities, not a preset class.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"346\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838890/extras/948572425ea936578013d914ae3cf4d2.poster.avif?t=1781544879\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838890/extras/948572425ea936578013d914ae3cf4d2.webm?t=1781544879\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838890/extras/948572425ea936578013d914ae3cf4d2.mp4?t=1781544879\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A World to Discover and Shape</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Journey through endless landscapes \u2014 from towering mountains to deep underground caverns. Build above ground to display your might, or hide your fortress beneath the earth to guard your treasures. Exploration isn\u2019t just encouraged \u2014 it\u2019s essential.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"346\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838890/extras/64e3b072d0abccda09d44bd15d5684eb.poster.avif?t=1781544879\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838890/extras/64e3b072d0abccda09d44bd15d5684eb.webm?t=1781544879\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838890/extras/64e3b072d0abccda09d44bd15d5684eb.mp4?t=1781544879\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Claim Land. Rule It. Tax It.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Raise your walls, fortify your defenses, and upgrade your structures. Claim territory across servers, control vital resources, and set taxes to fund your conquests. Land is power \u2014 and power is everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"346\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838890/extras/d3e66a56d5ff2ca3d15f730afd4d156e.poster.avif?t=1781544879\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838890/extras/d3e66a56d5ff2ca3d15f730afd4d156e.webm?t=1781544879\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838890/extras/d3e66a56d5ff2ca3d15f730afd4d156e.mp4?t=1781544879\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Mount Up for Adventure</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From swift warhorses to sturdy pack beasts, ground mounts offer speed, strength, and utility. Take to the skies with majestic flying mounts to scout enemy lines or reach hidden lands beyond mortal reach.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"346\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838890/extras/04cbe2a67282b76a5108a787b7761633.poster.avif?t=1781544879\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838890/extras/04cbe2a67282b76a5108a787b7761633.webm?t=1781544879\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838890/extras/04cbe2a67282b76a5108a787b7761633.mp4?t=1781544879\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"346\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838890/extras/78b8770c7a14c7a62ad47925387ab1ed.poster.avif?t=1781544879\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838890/extras/78b8770c7a14c7a62ad47925387ab1ed.webm?t=1781544879\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838890/extras/78b8770c7a14c7a62ad47925387ab1ed.mp4?t=1781544879\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Battlefields of Glory</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join massive, skill-based battles where weapon choice defines your abilities. From siege warfare to small skirmishes, your tactics \u2014 and your gear \u2014 decide the outcome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"346\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838890/extras/3de149c2fd8dfbea0a200553f2e5adeb.poster.avif?t=1781544879\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838890/extras/3de149c2fd8dfbea0a200553f2e5adeb.webm?t=1781544879\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838890/extras/3de149c2fd8dfbea0a200553f2e5adeb.mp4?t=1781544879\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Tame Beasts. Face Titans.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unwind with friends, tame exotic creatures, and venture into the wild. Brave ancient dungeons and challenge towering bosses in encounters where teamwork and preparation are key.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"346\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838890/extras/36113e019415c09f6b1944801a055846.poster.avif?t=1781544879\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838890/extras/36113e019415c09f6b1944801a055846.webm?t=1781544879\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838890/extras/36113e019415c09f6b1944801a055846.mp4?t=1781544879\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"346\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838890/extras/01913a1ced7f35acda532645f8560d3a.poster.avif?t=1781544879\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838890/extras/01913a1ced7f35acda532645f8560d3a.webm?t=1781544879\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838890/extras/01913a1ced7f35acda532645f8560d3a.mp4?t=1781544879\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"346\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838890/extras/109e40447ff5b8b8092da3b38f386878.poster.avif?t=1781544879\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838890/extras/109e40447ff5b8b8092da3b38f386878.webm?t=1781544879\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838890/extras/109e40447ff5b8b8092da3b38f386878.mp4?t=1781544879\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Your story is yours to forge. The realm awaits.</strong></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Mithrall is a Massive sandbox survival game with epic battles, dynamic exploration & real-time conquest. Shape the world, forge your legacy, and dominate in servers of up to 15,000 players in a living, breathing dwarven realm of war, trade, and ancient power.", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838890/e6c279934c699b60bf2e6ee4cbadb7add3761758/header.jpg?t=1781544879", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Massively Multiplayer", "MMORPG", "Open World", "Multiplayer", "PvP", "PvE"], "developers": "Mithrall Industries", "publishers": "Mithrall Industries", "release_date": "Q4 2027", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "2838890", "review_type": "Not Recommended", "curator_desc": "anklebreaker studio is garbage, removing Mithrall gameplay from youtube by issuing Copyright takedown notice, no NDA agrement, they want to lure people in scammy unfinished unoptimised game, STAY AWAY", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/kT0jg-MWTvs", "first_seen": 1781788551.0498464, "review_rank": 768}